Error: Jet.MarkerArgumentMismatch: `#Deadline` arguments do not match `Deadline(limit: Duration | Instant)`
  --> Tests/UI/context_deadline_wrong_type.jet:3:6
    |
  3 |     #Deadline("soon") { print("should not reach") }
    |      ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Marker arguments use the same call grammar and typed signature as function arguments
 Fix: Match the registered signature `Deadline(limit: Duration | Instant)`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.MarkerArgumentMismatch
